msgstr "Anbefalet"

msgid "--min-tps 0: nobody is waiting on these tokens, so nothing was excluded for generating more slowly than a person reads."
msgstr "--min-tps 0: ingen venter på disse tokens, så intet blev udeladt for at generere langsommere, end et menneske læser."

